[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Shady Saltseers (95789) - 10 Voodoo-Infused Artifacts - |cffffcc00grind|r: 41-43% from each Saltseer pirate (Murderer 40.6%, Cultist 42.8%, Manhunter 41.4%, Coroner 41.9%), ~25 kills, and the run's own Saltseer kills count. Short at the exit = abandon
