[O]Kill [TAR263196 Profane Necromancer], [TAR258792 Risen Sentry] and [TAR263899 Undying Offering] for 5 I'lalai Fetishes [QC95788] (9-17% - grind/luck) [G21.4,27.9 Stranglethorn Vale]
